<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cornerstone Imaging.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cornerstone Imaging.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities analyst Jeffrey Lin said he raised his rating on Cornerstone Imaging Inc to a buy from a hold.</p>
<p>-- Lin is estimating a loss of $0.05 per share in fiscal 1996 ending in December and a profit of $0.58 per share in 1997.  His target price is $15, or about 53 percent over the stock's current price.</p>
<p>-- Cornerstone provides hardware and software components for integrating document images into standard computing systems.</p>
</text>
